    "name": "Quiet Farm",
    "steam_appid": 1771040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/6608f694269aaf47297742e7b6be0b4f.avif?t=1708439315\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/8d350a3cf992b49d4bac0b3c98f43bbb.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/8d350a3cf992b49d4bac0b3c98f43bbb.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Join forces of a cow and a small alien and embark upon a fantastic adventure! Use the rich interactive environment to solve puzzles and fight your enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/caac2ba1c5ca53d036fd9c7306216a18.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/caac2ba1c5ca53d036fd9c7306216a18.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/caac2ba1c5ca53d036fd9c7306216a18.mp4?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>STORY-DRIVEN GAME</strong><br><br>Meet the cute cow named Duchess. She lives on a Quiet Farm and does what cows do: eats grass and gives milk.<br>Her life takes a sharp turn after she meets Blurs, the little alien. Together they uncover a global catastrophe behind the peaceful life on a farm.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/b4ecec6b340e2cf7fd3a6d74b4e3f496.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/b4ecec6b340e2cf7fd3a6d74b4e3f496.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/b4ecec6b340e2cf7fd3a6d74b4e3f496.mp4?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>CONTROL THE COW</strong><br><br>The game protagonist is a simple cow. Head-butting and kicking, eating grass, and plopping cow-pats are the only things that the Cow can do. Use these abilities to explore the game world, interact with a variety of environments, find new beneficial sorts of grass, solve puzzles, and crush enemies with your mighty horns!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/af1649d2dceed0cba9d3ed5f8c686967.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/af1649d2dceed0cba9d3ed5f8c686967.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/af1649d2dceed0cba9d3ed5f8c686967.mp4?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>CONTROL THE UFO</strong><br><br>Even a big cow sometimes needs help in dealing with obstacles or finding ways to interact with the environment.<br>You can switch to controlling the UFO at any moment.<br>- Move objects by hooking them with your Magnetic Beam<br>- Set combustible things on fire with the Plasma Gun<br>- Use the Taser to shock enemies or power up electrical appliances<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/64536d8380dbc02c881bbfe271f56285.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/64536d8380dbc02c881bbfe271f56285.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/64536d8380dbc02c881bbfe271f56285.mp4?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>INTERACTIVE ENVIRONMENT AND PUZZLES</strong><br><br>The game world is full of environmental interactions. You can and have to employ different approaches to solve puzzles, fight enemies, and reach secret locations. Find your favorite way of dealing with obstacles: destroy, zap, burn, move, freeze, or even flush them!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/c8ecc4a82f9e0ec79fc6a9bf826999e6.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/c8ecc4a82f9e0ec79fc6a9bf826999e6.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/c8ecc4a82f9e0ec79fc6a9bf826999e6.mp4?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>ELEMENTAL INTERACTIONS</strong><br><br>Take advantage of the physical properties of your environment. Experiment with weights, flammability, fluids, freezing, and electrical conductivity.<br>If you see a wooden enemy, it should burn well. If you find an elevator, try attaching something heavy to the rope to make it lift. Or maybe find its engine and power it up?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/3d483b36944664213e3df98f9856b34f.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/3d483b36944664213e3df98f9856b34f.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/3d483b36944664213e3df98f9856b34f.mp4?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>CRAFTING IN THE STOMACH</strong><br><br>Cows have multi-compartment stomachs, where each part serves its own purpose. Explore the world to find rare herbs, split into components and re-compose them for nutrition. You can improve the cow\u2019s speed, endurance, and strength, and don\u2019t forget that the UFO uses dung as fuel.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/6608f694269aaf47297742e7b6be0b4f.avif?t=1708439315\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/8d350a3cf992b49d4bac0b3c98f43bbb.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/8d350a3cf992b49d4bac0b3c98f43bbb.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Join forces of a cow and a small alien and embark upon a fantastic adventure! Use the rich interactive environment to solve puzzles and fight your enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/caac2ba1c5ca53d036fd9c7306216a18.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/caac2ba1c5ca53d036fd9c7306216a18.webm?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/caac2ba1c5ca53d036fd9c7306216a18.mp4?t=1708439315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>STORY-DRIVEN GAME</strong><br><br>Meet the cute cow named Duchess. She lives on a Quiet Farm and does what cows do: eats grass and gives milk.<br>Her life takes a sharp turn after she meets Blurs, the little alien. Together they uncover a global catastrophe behind the peaceful life on a farm.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771040/extras/b4ecec6b340e2cf7fd3a6d74b4e3f496.poster.avif?t=1708439315\" 